    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22585" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-crasso</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make thick</i> or <i>stout</i>
			(post-class.; used mostly in the <i>part.</i>),
					<i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Psych.
			6</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-crassātus</span></b> , a, um, P.
			a., <i>made stout</i>, <i>fattened</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 3, 6</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Jejun. 6</span></i>.</div>
